---
// src/components/About.astro
---
<section id="about" class="container">
  <div class="about-grid">
    
    <div class="about-title">
      <h2 class="heading-font">Interest &<br/>Motivation.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-statement">
        <h3 class="heading-font">"I believe that brilliant architecture is invisible; you only notice the impact it creates."</h3>
      </div>
      
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          As a Computer Science student specializing in Database Technology, my true passion lies in the foundation of technology: turning chaotic, fragmented data into structured, scalable solutions. While many are drawn to the surface-level magic of applications, I am captivated by what happens behind the scenes—the data engineering, the ETL pipelines, and the backend architecture that makes everything else possible.
        </p>
        <p>
          I thrive on solving structural puzzles. A system is only as good as the data feeding it, which is why I focus on ensuring that information flows are robust, clean, and seamlessly integrated. From processing complex datasets to modeling star schemas for business intelligence, I build the quiet engines that drive informed decision-making.
        </p>
        <p>
          Ultimately, I engineer with empathy. Whether I am architecting a data pipeline for a corporate dashboard or deploying a management system for a local community, my guiding principle remains the same. I aim to bridge complex technical architecture with human-centric design, ensuring that the systems I build don't just process data, but truly empower the people who rely on them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #about {
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; /* Membagi layout 1/3 untuk Judul, 2/3 untuk Konten */
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .about-title h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text-color);
    margin: 0;
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px; /* Membuat judul tetap terlihat saat di-scroll di laptop */
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-statement h3 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--accent-color);
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-color);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media print {
    #about { padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; page-break-inside: avoid; }
    .about-grid { gap: 2rem; }
    .about-title h2 { font-size: 2rem; position: static; }
    .about-statement h3 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
    .about-text p { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  }

  /* --- MOBILE RESPONSIVE --- */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #about { 
      padding-top: 2rem; 
      padding-bottom: 3rem; 
      margin-bottom: 3rem; 
    }
    
    .about-grid { 
      grid-template-columns: 1fr; /* Berubah menjadi 1 kolom ke bawah di HP */
      gap: 2rem; 
    }
    
    .about-title h2 { 
      position: static; 
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
    
    .about-statement h3 { 
      font-size: 1.8rem; 
    }
  }
</style>